== Trivia ==
* It is one of 6 crafting ingredients obtained by combining its raw material 3 times ({{Item|Ender Pearl}}, {{Item|Enchanted Ender Pearl}}, {{Item|Absolute Ender Pearl}}, {{Item|Tesselated Ender Pearl}}). The others are the {{Item|Refined Diamond}}, the {{Item|Omega Enchanted Egg}}, the {{Item|Diamond Magmafish}}, and the {{Item|Diamond Lotus}} (and formerly the {{Item|Tightly-Tied Hay Bale}}).
* Its item ID <code>TESSELLATED_ENDER_PEARL</code> was spelled with 2 "L"s, whereas its name "Tesselated Ender Pearl" was displayed with 1 "L". The word "Tesselated" is misspelled, actually being "Tessellated", hence the incident.
* It can be crafted before the {{Item|Absolute Ender Pearl}} can be crafted. This is one of the only cases where a crafting item can be crafted before its predecessor.
* Despite needing stacked Tessellated Ender Pearls in the crafting recipe of {{Item|Terminator}}, it was unstackable until [[Changelog/2022/November 9|Update 0.16.1]]
* Before being changed to custom items, its texture was a recolored version of {{Item|Absolute Ender Pearl}}.

